Dative singular of "brat" (brother) is "bratovi" or "brata"? Let me think: Slovak masculine animate nouns in the dative singular take -ovi (bratovi) or -u (bratu). Brat: nominative brat, genitive brata, dative bratovi / bratu. Both are correct; the standard form is "bratovi" (also "bratu").

The requested format is a single form, so I'll give the most common one.

{"form": "bratovi"}

